WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.450
RCAP Carpool introduces
nearby families.

2
00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:07.050
It’s optional and parent-led.

3
00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:08.900
You make the arrangements.

4
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.200
Step one.

5
00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:12.600
Add your family.

6
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.550
Choose your address,
days, and rides.

7
00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.050
Verify your email,

8
00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.520
then wait for approval.

9
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.000
Step two.

10
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.100
Find nearby families.

11
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:26.650
Compare schedules
and explore the map.

12
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:30.300
It shows general areas,
never home addresses.

13
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.030
Nearby doesn’t always
mean a match.

14
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.000
Step three.

15
00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:36.900
Connect and plan.

16
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.650
Ask to join a group,
or create your own.

17
00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.200
Nobody is added automatically.

18
00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.280
Choose to share your email
and phone with the group.

19
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.150
Sharing starts once
membership is approved.

20
00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.100
Then connect, meet,

21
00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.750
and agree on rides together.

22
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.670
Parents take it from there.
